1
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:14,597
Listen for a moment. A car
passes. A bird. The hum of a fan.

2
00:00:14,677 --> 00:00:16,254
Each sound is clear.

3
00:00:16,334 --> 00:00:18,781
Nothing had to switch
on for it to be clear.

4
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:20,498
It was clear as it came.

5
00:00:21,304 --> 00:00:22,872
Now the old stories.

6
00:00:22,952 --> 00:00:25,495
A master dies in a small room in Tibet.

7
00:00:25,575 --> 00:00:28,022
Over a week the body grows smaller.

8
00:00:28,102 --> 00:00:30,209
Rainbows are seen over the roof.

9
00:00:30,289 --> 00:00:33,882
When the door is opened,
only hair and nails are left.

10
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:38,452
What could the clearness of a passing
sound have to do with a body turning into

11
00:00:38,532 --> 00:00:40,738
light? More than it seems.

12
00:00:40,818 --> 00:00:43,651
In this video I want
to show you that link.

13
00:00:44,448 --> 00:00:45,989
This is After Anatta.

14
00:00:46,069 --> 00:00:48,163
Here I bring together what I have written,

15
00:00:48,243 --> 00:00:51,573
across my books and
articles, about two things.

16
00:00:51,653 --> 00:00:55,323
Non-dual luminous appearances.
And the rainbow body.

17
00:00:55,403 --> 00:00:58,299
What I see is simple
to say and hard to see.

18
00:00:58,379 --> 00:01:01,071
The rainbow body is luminous appearances,

19
00:01:01,151 --> 00:01:04,698
recognised all the way through
form, the body included.

20
00:01:04,778 --> 00:01:06,673
And nothing turns into light.

21
00:01:07,492 --> 00:01:10,691
The rainbow body has
interested me for many years.

22
00:01:10,771 --> 00:01:15,596
I wanted to read it in a balanced way.
Not dismissing it. Not inflating it.

23
00:01:15,676 --> 00:01:17,607
So I looked into four things.

24
00:01:17,687 --> 00:01:20,541
The energy practices of
different traditions.

25
00:01:20,621 --> 00:01:24,223
The five elements, as Tibet
and China each count them.

26
00:01:24,303 --> 00:01:26,982
The reports of the rainbow body itself.

27
00:01:27,062 --> 00:01:30,392
And what modern research finds
about how the body knows.

28
00:01:30,472 --> 00:01:32,652
This video brings them together.

29
00:01:33,464 --> 00:01:35,019
Let me start with clarity.

30
00:01:36,036 --> 00:01:38,854
When I say luminosity, I mean one thing.

31
00:01:38,934 --> 00:01:41,708
It is the knowing clarity
of appearing itself.

32
00:01:41,788 --> 00:01:45,104
I prefer to say luminous
appearances, in the plural.

33
00:01:45,184 --> 00:01:47,034
A sound is heard as sound.

34
00:01:47,114 --> 00:01:51,748
Its clearness is not found apart from
the sound, the ear and the hearing.

35
00:01:51,828 --> 00:01:54,833
It is not a light shining
on things from behind.

36
00:01:54,913 --> 00:01:57,536
It is not a knower
standing apart to see them.

37
00:01:57,616 --> 00:01:59,810
And it is as empty as everything else.

38
00:02:00,616 --> 00:02:02,619
Luminous does not mean bright.

39
00:02:02,699 --> 00:02:04,739
A dull ache is clear as dull.

40
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:07,986
Darkness is seen, vividly, as dark.

41
00:02:08,066 --> 00:02:12,483
A grey wall is as vivid as a sunset,
in the sense that matters here.

42
00:02:12,563 --> 00:02:14,630
Vivid means nothing in between.

43
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:16,356
Not extra intensity.

44
00:02:16,436 --> 00:02:18,670
Just appearing, met directly.

45
00:02:19,484 --> 00:02:21,446
And clarity is never missing.

46
00:02:21,526 --> 00:02:24,789
You cannot speak of anything
appearing without clarity.

47
00:02:24,869 --> 00:02:29,245
The only question is whether the clarity
is lifted out and made into a thing.

48
00:02:29,325 --> 00:02:31,786
Nāgārjuna has a verse about a lamp.

49
00:02:31,866 --> 00:02:35,319
A lamp lights itself and
others, his opponent says.

50
00:02:35,399 --> 00:02:39,449
Nāgārjuna answers that in a lamp
there is no darkness to remove.

51
00:02:39,529 --> 00:02:41,188
I read that verse simply.

52
00:02:41,268 --> 00:02:44,820
No appearing ever waited in the
dark for a knower to light it up.

53
00:02:45,624 --> 00:02:48,932
There is not even one
clarity. There are six.

54
00:02:49,012 --> 00:02:52,573
Seeing is clear in its own
way. Hearing in its own way.

55
00:02:52,653 --> 00:02:55,929
Touching, tasting, smelling, thinking.

56
00:02:56,009 --> 00:02:57,641
Six lamps, not one.

57
00:02:57,721 --> 00:02:59,774
And no lamp that lights itself.

58
00:02:59,854 --> 00:03:03,950
That is why I say luminous
appearances, not one luminous clarity.

59
00:03:04,756 --> 00:03:09,300
So what goes wrong? The mind notices
that every appearing is clear.

60
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:11,202
It notices the sameness.

61
00:03:11,282 --> 00:03:16,759
Then it lifts that sameness out and calls
it awareness. A background. A witness.

62
00:03:16,839 --> 00:03:18,892
A mirror. A ground.

63
00:03:18,972 --> 00:03:20,686
The clearness was authentic.

64
00:03:20,766 --> 00:03:22,891
Making it a thing is the error.

65
00:03:23,696 --> 00:03:26,161
That error has many disguises.

66
00:03:26,241 --> 00:03:29,449
A lamp that is always
on, behind everything.

67
00:03:29,529 --> 00:03:31,922
A lamp left burning through deep sleep.

68
00:03:32,002 --> 00:03:34,463
A lamp behind glass, watching.

69
00:03:34,543 --> 00:03:38,620
Or a lamp put out, so that emptiness
becomes a kind of darkness.

70
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:42,076
Each one keeps a light
somewhere, standing on its own.

71
00:03:42,876 --> 00:03:44,988
And there is a deeper version still.

72
00:03:45,068 --> 00:03:47,936
A subtle clear light, hidden
under the coarse mind,

73
00:03:48,016 --> 00:03:52,760
like a lamp under a basket, waiting to
be uncovered. I read it differently.

74
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,947
Subtle means fewer conditions.

75
00:03:55,027 --> 00:03:57,026
It does not mean a deeper stuff.

76
00:03:57,106 --> 00:04:00,586
The coarse minds were never
darkness covering a truer light.

77
00:04:00,666 --> 00:04:03,837
What they add is the knot
of grasping, not a cover.

78
00:04:04,648 --> 00:04:09,083
There is a name for this clearness
that many practitioners know. I AM.

79
00:04:09,163 --> 00:04:13,716
For me, I AM names luminous
clarity itself, realised directly.

80
00:04:13,796 --> 00:04:17,779
It is authentic. What turns it
into a witness, an observer,

81
00:04:17,859 --> 00:04:21,013
a background awareness, is
the sense of I added to it.

82
00:04:21,093 --> 00:04:24,359
The clarity is not the error. The I is.

83
00:04:25,172 --> 00:04:28,955
That is how it went for me.
Presence was vivid from early on.

84
00:04:29,035 --> 00:04:32,080
But it belonged to someone.
It was my awareness.

85
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:36,170
Then I made it a Witness.
Then a Source. Then a Mirror.

86
00:04:36,250 --> 00:04:38,656
Then a seamless field
of luminous presence,

87
00:04:38,736 --> 00:04:42,094
non-dual, but still something
real on its own side.

88
00:04:42,174 --> 00:04:45,314
For many years I believed
this was the destination.

89
00:04:45,394 --> 00:04:47,556
The question that turned it was simple.

90
00:04:47,636 --> 00:04:50,495
Does Presence itself
exist from its own side?

91
00:04:51,312 --> 00:04:54,293
Around nineteen ninety-seven, anatta came.

92
00:04:54,373 --> 00:04:57,350
No seer behind seeing. Just the seen.

93
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,823
The hearer was never
more than the hearing.

94
00:04:59,903 --> 00:05:02,038
It was a genuine realization.

95
00:05:02,118 --> 00:05:05,774
But each deconstruction frees
only what it has relinquished.

96
00:05:05,854 --> 00:05:10,720
Anatta relinquished the self, and the
Self behind it, and that much was freed.

97
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,514
The world was not yet.

98
00:05:12,594 --> 00:05:15,856
The self had dissolved,
but the universe had not.

99
00:05:15,936 --> 00:05:18,193
Space still sat like a container.

100
00:05:18,273 --> 00:05:20,475
Time still ran like a conveyor belt.

101
00:05:20,555 --> 00:05:23,818
And awareness could still
quietly become a subtle ground.

102
00:05:23,898 --> 00:05:26,793
That habit has to be seen
through in each place it works,

103
00:05:26,873 --> 00:05:31,485
in space, time, cause,
death and the world itself.

104
00:05:32,284 --> 00:05:34,274
What sees it through is emptiness.

105
00:05:34,354 --> 00:05:38,010
Not only the emptiness of the self,
but of everything that appears,

106
00:05:38,090 --> 00:05:39,695
and of the clarity itself.

107
00:05:39,775 --> 00:05:44,640
Even the luminosity, even the awareness,
is seen as dependently designated.

108
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,737
That is twofold emptiness.

109
00:05:47,552 --> 00:05:49,623
I should be honest about where I am.

110
00:05:49,703 --> 00:05:52,925
The deconstruction of
self and Self in anatta,

111
00:05:53,005 --> 00:05:57,327
and then total exertion, where all
conditions are fully this one moment,

112
00:05:57,407 --> 00:05:59,895
gave a taste that keeps
bringing me forward.

113
00:05:59,975 --> 00:06:01,824
But it is not a finished state.

114
00:06:01,904 --> 00:06:04,261
Even now it is still in oscillation.

115
00:06:05,076 --> 00:06:06,672
And here the two halves meet.

116
00:06:06,752 --> 00:06:11,155
The vividness of the apple and its
unfindability are not two facts.

117
00:06:11,235 --> 00:06:13,723
They are one fact, seen twice.

118
00:06:13,803 --> 00:06:18,085
The red is vivid exactly because
it depends on light, eye and skin.

119
00:06:18,165 --> 00:06:20,109
It is never found apart from them.

120
00:06:20,189 --> 00:06:23,003
The clarity is not
found from its own side,

121
00:06:23,083 --> 00:06:25,381
and the emptiness is never a blank.

122
00:06:25,461 --> 00:06:27,777
Each is the other's way of being said.

123
00:06:28,576 --> 00:06:30,973
Dzogchen has a word for this side of it.

124
00:06:31,053 --> 00:06:32,957
Spontaneous presence.

125
00:06:33,037 --> 00:06:37,576
For me, spontaneous presence is
dependent arising with no producer.

126
00:06:37,656 --> 00:06:42,712
It is dependent arising described from the
side of experience instead of analysis.

127
00:06:42,792 --> 00:06:46,299
Neither description is
higher. Each guards the other.

128
00:06:46,379 --> 00:06:51,041
Dependent arising stops spontaneous
presence being heard as a hidden source.

129
00:06:51,121 --> 00:06:55,593
Spontaneous presence stops dependent
arising being heard as a machine running

130
00:06:55,673 --> 00:06:58,043
in the dark, waiting for a knower.

131
00:06:58,844 --> 00:07:00,956
There is one guard I keep close.

132
00:07:01,036 --> 00:07:05,168
If only the vividness is affirmed,
presence turns into a new ground.

133
00:07:05,248 --> 00:07:10,113
If only the unfindability is affirmed,
the world turns thin and void.

134
00:07:10,193 --> 00:07:12,210
Both halves, always.

135
00:07:13,008 --> 00:07:14,264
Now the body.

136
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:18,888
Dzogchen speaks of the
basis in three aspects.

137
00:07:18,968 --> 00:07:21,714
Its essence is empty,
pure from the beginning.

138
00:07:21,794 --> 00:07:23,398
Its nature is clear.

139
00:07:23,478 --> 00:07:25,436
And its display never stops.

140
00:07:25,516 --> 00:07:27,379
I follow Longchenpa here.

141
00:07:27,459 --> 00:07:30,287
The basis is empty of being a ground.

142
00:07:30,367 --> 00:07:33,498
Nothing that appearing
comes from, or rests on.

143
00:07:34,304 --> 00:07:37,729
The display first shows
as sound, light and rays,

144
00:07:37,809 --> 00:07:39,541
and the light as five lights.

145
00:07:39,621 --> 00:07:43,495
When the display is not recognised
as the basis's own radiance,

146
00:07:43,575 --> 00:07:46,579
it is taken as something
other, standing over there.

147
00:07:46,659 --> 00:07:51,239
Then, the tantras say, the five
lights harden into the five elements.

148
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:54,120
From the elements come
the body and the world.

149
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:57,562
So the ordinary body is
light not recognised.

150
00:07:58,356 --> 00:08:02,261
The rainbow body is said to be the
same process run the other way.

151
00:08:02,341 --> 00:08:05,142
When the display is recognised
through and through,

152
00:08:05,222 --> 00:08:08,040
nothing holds the elements
as solid any more.

153
00:08:08,848 --> 00:08:11,096
One caution before going further.

154
00:08:11,176 --> 00:08:14,465
The five lights should not be
read through our own culture,

155
00:08:14,545 --> 00:08:16,476
or through modern knowledge of light.

156
00:08:16,556 --> 00:08:20,960
The five elements have their own
background in Indian and Tibetan thought,

157
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:23,609
and the five lights only
make sense against it.

158
00:08:23,689 --> 00:08:26,340
I set out that background
in a short video,

159
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:29,538
Five Elements: Chinese versus Tibet.

160
00:08:30,332 --> 00:08:31,968
But listen to that carefully.

161
00:08:32,048 --> 00:08:35,243
It is easy to hear the lights
as a shining stuff underneath,

162
00:08:35,323 --> 00:08:37,960
and the body as frozen
light that melts back.

163
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:42,557
Read that way, it is a substrate
again, made of light instead of matter.

164
00:08:43,368 --> 00:08:46,988
I read it another way. The
five lights are not a stuff.

165
00:08:47,068 --> 00:08:50,330
They name the clarity of
appearing, in five qualities,

166
00:08:50,410 --> 00:08:52,029
as empty as what appears.

167
00:08:52,109 --> 00:08:55,521
Condensing into the elements
names how appearing is taken.

168
00:08:55,601 --> 00:08:58,116
It does not name a stuff turning solid.

169
00:08:58,196 --> 00:09:01,748
The trouble was never the
clarity. It was the grasping.

170
00:09:02,548 --> 00:09:08,478
Hold an apple. The hardness. The
coolness. The red. The sweetness.

171
00:09:08,558 --> 00:09:11,317
Each arises only as its conditions meet.

172
00:09:11,397 --> 00:09:13,437
None is found stored in the apple.

173
00:09:13,517 --> 00:09:15,489
Then a habit ties them together.

174
00:09:15,569 --> 00:09:20,692
One solid apple, out there, as if hardness
and red and sweetness all belonged to a

175
00:09:20,772 --> 00:09:21,972
hidden core.

176
00:09:22,688 --> 00:09:27,517
That habit is the knot. Dzogchen describes
the same moment from the side of light:

177
00:09:27,597 --> 00:09:31,539
the display taken as other,
condensing into a solid world.

178
00:09:31,619 --> 00:09:35,765
I describe it from the side of the view:
a habit tying separate appearings into a

179
00:09:35,845 --> 00:09:39,220
thing. One movement, described twice.

180
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,594
Untie the knot, and nothing is lost.

181
00:09:42,674 --> 00:09:48,395
There is just this hardness, this red,
this coolness, this sweetness. Vivid.

182
00:09:48,475 --> 00:09:50,773
Appearing as their
conditions come together.

183
00:09:50,853 --> 00:09:53,572
Dzogchen would say, the five lights.

184
00:09:53,652 --> 00:09:56,797
I say, just this, vivid and light.

185
00:09:57,592 --> 00:10:00,909
When read this way, from a
non-substantialist standpoint,

186
00:10:00,989 --> 00:10:03,463
what we call things
are only the six lamps,

187
00:10:03,543 --> 00:10:06,158
unrecognised, as I showed with the apple.

188
00:10:06,238 --> 00:10:09,396
It holds true for anything,
the body included.

189
00:10:10,196 --> 00:10:12,811
And the body is held the
way the apple is held.

190
00:10:12,891 --> 00:10:16,724
Hardness, warmth, weight
and the felt sense of mine,

191
00:10:16,804 --> 00:10:19,319
tied into one solid body, in here.

192
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:23,436
The rainbow body, in essence, is
that knot untied all the way through,

193
00:10:23,516 --> 00:10:25,043
the body included.

194
00:10:25,848 --> 00:10:28,612
So, in essence, it is a realization.

195
00:10:28,692 --> 00:10:33,232
In two thousand thirteen I wrote that the
rainbow body in Dzogchen does not mean

196
00:10:33,312 --> 00:10:34,998
that your body disappears.

197
00:10:35,078 --> 00:10:38,558
And when someone summed it up
as, in essence a realization,

198
00:10:38,638 --> 00:10:42,742
I added: maybe actualization
of realization would be better.

199
00:10:42,822 --> 00:10:45,478
In essence it is an actualized state.

200
00:10:46,276 --> 00:10:48,252
I also said what it rests on.

201
00:10:48,332 --> 00:10:54,332
Twofold emptiness, and luminosity carried
into all three states. Waking. Dreaming.

202
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:59,488
Deep sleep. And that this is supported
by the strength of view and realization.

203
00:10:59,568 --> 00:11:03,184
Not by the intensity of a
non-conceptual experience.

204
00:11:03,264 --> 00:11:06,445
So it is not a special
experience, however bright.

205
00:11:06,525 --> 00:11:10,498
It is the view, realised, and
carried through day and night.

206
00:11:11,312 --> 00:11:15,611
Dzogchen calls the last of its four
visions the exhaustion of phenomena.

207
00:11:15,691 --> 00:11:18,111
What is exhausted? Not appearing.

208
00:11:18,191 --> 00:11:22,119
What is used up is appearing held
as things, each with its own mark.

209
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:25,530
Even the lights of the visions
are not kept as something seen.

210
00:11:25,610 --> 00:11:27,744
In twenty twenty I put it this way.

211
00:11:27,824 --> 00:11:31,739
Exhaustion of phenomena is like the
sense of observer being dissolved,

212
00:11:31,819 --> 00:11:37,819
and the sense of object also disappearing.
No seer. No seeing. Nothing seen.

213
00:11:38,055 --> 00:11:39,665
And appearing goes on.

214
00:11:40,476 --> 00:11:44,028
Then how does one get there?
Here I part from the traditions.

215
00:11:44,108 --> 00:11:47,425
Dzogchen gives the appearing
side a practice of its own.

216
00:11:47,505 --> 00:11:50,971
The Gelug school works through
the winds and the subtle body.

217
00:11:51,051 --> 00:11:54,938
Taoist inner alchemy refines
energy into a body of spirit.

218
00:11:55,018 --> 00:11:58,362
The method is shared
widely. The view is not.

219
00:11:58,442 --> 00:12:02,900
The winds, channels and drops these
practices work with are set out in another

220
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:06,886
of my videos, Inner Winds
and Subtle Body Practices.

221
00:12:07,696 --> 00:12:11,153
For me, what frees is seeing
through the inherent framework.

222
00:12:11,233 --> 00:12:16,628
Not where the winds go. No practice of
winds, channels or drops makes the lights.

223
00:12:16,708 --> 00:12:20,025
Nothing such a practice does
turns a body into light.

224
00:12:20,105 --> 00:12:22,226
The way is a de-reification.

225
00:12:22,306 --> 00:12:25,501
Seeing that what seems
so solid, so direct,

226
00:12:25,581 --> 00:12:29,101
so undeniable, is vivid
appearing, found nowhere.

227
00:12:29,181 --> 00:12:32,158
That is not easier than
any energy practice.

228
00:12:32,238 --> 00:12:34,310
It is just as hard to break through.

229
00:12:35,108 --> 00:12:37,084
The body is not left out.

230
00:12:37,164 --> 00:12:39,367
The knot is not only an idea.

231
00:12:39,447 --> 00:12:43,877
It is held in the chest, the breath
and the belly. A slight bracing.

232
00:12:43,957 --> 00:12:45,127
A held breath.

233
00:12:45,207 --> 00:12:49,435
A lean toward the next moment, as if
the world had to be held together.

234
00:12:49,515 --> 00:12:53,266
Modern research agrees that much
of our knowing happens in the body,

235
00:12:53,346 --> 00:12:58,416
before thought, and that fear and clinging
are felt and released there first.

236
00:12:58,496 --> 00:13:00,576
The old traditions said it their way.

237
00:13:00,656 --> 00:13:03,760
The mind rides the wind,
like a rider on a horse.

238
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:08,085
Two guards. This felt
knowing is more immediate.

239
00:13:08,165 --> 00:13:09,906
It is not more fundamental.

240
00:13:09,986 --> 00:13:12,759
It is not a deeper floor
beneath experience,

241
00:13:12,839 --> 00:13:14,892
and it is as empty as what it knows.

242
00:13:14,972 --> 00:13:16,944
And direct does not mean right.

243
00:13:17,024 --> 00:13:20,707
In anxiety, the body reports
a danger that is not there.

244
00:13:20,787 --> 00:13:24,163
I set this out in an article,
The Body's Own Knowing.

245
00:13:24,964 --> 00:13:27,683
In my own experience,
when the view let go,

246
00:13:27,763 --> 00:13:32,157
the mind and the body's energy
opened by themselves, without effort.

247
00:13:32,237 --> 00:13:35,038
I was not forcing the
breath to break the knots.

248
00:13:35,118 --> 00:13:38,285
The knot in the body uncoiled
when the knot in the view did.

249
00:13:38,365 --> 00:13:41,723
Energy practices can help
loosen what the body holds.

250
00:13:41,803 --> 00:13:45,382
But luminous appearances were
never a product of the winds.

251
00:13:46,184 --> 00:13:50,837
And the shrinking corpse? The logic
shows how the body is known and lived.

252
00:13:50,917 --> 00:13:53,812
It does not show what others
will see at a funeral.

253
00:13:53,892 --> 00:13:57,712
That a body physically vanishes
is reported, not proved.

254
00:13:57,792 --> 00:13:59,831
So here is my balanced reading.

255
00:13:59,911 --> 00:14:04,451
What is genuinely shown is that the body
takes part in knowing and in release.

256
00:14:04,531 --> 00:14:09,152
The knot is held in the chest, the breath
and the belly, as much as in the mind.

257
00:14:09,232 --> 00:14:12,209
What is not shown is that
a corpse turns into light.

258
00:14:12,289 --> 00:14:14,383
I hold the first with confidence.

259
00:14:14,463 --> 00:14:17,032
The second, I hold as a report.

260
00:14:17,112 --> 00:14:20,062
Many great masters left ordinary bodies.

261
00:14:20,142 --> 00:14:22,807
Insight is measured by
the freedom of the mind,

262
00:14:22,887 --> 00:14:24,944
not by what happens to the body.

263
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:27,240
And it is not a goal.

264
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:30,977
To practise for a body of light is
still to practise for something.

265
00:14:31,057 --> 00:14:33,368
Tibetans speak of a leather butter bag.

266
00:14:33,448 --> 00:14:36,371
Worked with butter while
in use, it stays soft.

267
00:14:36,451 --> 00:14:39,156
Left full and never worked, it goes hard,

268
00:14:39,236 --> 00:14:41,140
and cannot be softened again.

269
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:44,944
Knowledge of the lights that is
never tested hardens the same way.

270
00:14:45,024 --> 00:14:48,232
While I still think inherently,
the elements stay solid,

271
00:14:48,312 --> 00:14:50,207
however much I hear about light.

272
00:14:51,016 --> 00:14:55,954
So I come back to the sound.
The car. The bird. The fan.

273
00:14:56,034 --> 00:14:57,924
Each one clear as it comes.

274
00:14:58,004 --> 00:15:00,886
No lamp behind it. No one holding it.

275
00:15:00,966 --> 00:15:03,295
Found nowhere, and never missing.

276
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:06,905
If nothing is found,
what turns into light?

277
00:15:06,985 --> 00:15:09,052
Nothing found turns into light.

278
00:15:09,132 --> 00:15:11,850
The body appeared solid
because it was held.

279
00:15:11,930 --> 00:15:15,030
When the holding ends,
it no longer appears so.

280
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:19,704
Luminous appearances, recognised all
the way through, the body included.

281
00:15:19,784 --> 00:15:21,529
That is the rainbow body.

